Subject: Re: map_dbl() vs c() for processing POSIX datetime's
Message-ID: <jK_meb_dhNI.ERgLyFGuCQAJ@manipulatr.groups.google.com>
In-Reply-To: <jK_meb_dhNI.e6Tbiqe_AwAJ@manipulatr.groups.google.com>
